# UTF-16 with astral (non-BMP) codepoints: surrogate pairs must decode to 4-byte UTF-8
query I
SELECT * FROM read_csv('{DATA_DIR}/csv/encodings/utf16_astral.csv', encoding = 'utf-16', header = 0, quote = '', auto_detect = false, columns = {'name':'varchar'}, delim = '')
----
Emoji 😀 Test
Astral 𝕏 Math
CJK 日本語 end

