# Astral (non-BMP): utf-16be via surrogate pairs, utf-32 stores the codepoint directly
query I
SELECT * FROM read_csv('{DATA_DIR}/csv/encodings/utf16be_astral.csv', encoding = 'utf-16be', header = 0, quote = '', auto_detect = false, columns = {'name':'varchar'}, delim = '')
----
Emoji 😀 Test
Astral 𝕏 Math
CJK 日本語 end

